契约覆盖:
  header: PipelineFrame=n_blocks纯命名块容器, AioBlock 7类型(FLOAT32..RAW), AioKVEntry 64+256=320B,
          BLOCKER-DF-001 MAX_BLOCKS=65536 MAX_DIMS=4 STR_LEN=65535 4GiB/块 16GiB/帧 (防损坏输入异常分配)
  dtype/copy/move: add_block deep-copy, replace f32->f64, add_block_move 接管 aio_alloc 指针(跨DLL aio_free)
  KV: header块 KV set/get string + double(%.17g) string往返
  frame lifecycle: create/destroy, remove_block(存在/不存在), has_block/list_blocks, stages_completed 位掩码
  .aio cache: AIO1 magic+version+n_blocks+stages_completed, atomically save/load, dtype/dims/payload bit-exact,
               截断/负n_blocks/n_dims>4 拒绝且不破坏原帧(事务性)
  invalid args: 负count/未知type(add/move) 拒绝且不接管所有权
  engine: STAGE_CALIBRATE..STACK 5阶段, auto_free 策略(PLATESOLVE:weight / PHOTOMETRIC:star_det,gaia_cat,psf
          / DRIZZLE:data,snr,weight,grad_map,cal_stats,photo_stats / STACK:healpix), header全生命周期保留

